WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Sections. Group a project's list into named sections, separate from board columns.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: phased launch; imported structure.

3
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:10.590
Sections group the list view by phase or area.

4
00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.970
Choose + Add section…

5
00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.960
…name it and add it.

6
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.530
Put a task in a section from its drawer.

7
00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:22.030
The list now groups by section; everything else sits under No section.

8
00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:28.030
I can't see sections on the board: Sections belong to the list view; the board groups by column.

9
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:32.530
Independent of board columns
